  "details": "I noticed today that if I grab the camera on the right side like in the image and press trigger to take a photo it can also change the settings to the right such as the zoom and f-stop sliders.\nTo reproduce just aim the laser at one of the sliders then grab it with that hand. The laser will disappear as it should do, however when you press trigger it will take the photo and will also change the slider to the position you was aiming at, as if the laser it still there.",
